Subject: [PATCH 046/200] PartDesign: list the picked faces and edges of
 fillets, chamfers, drafts and thickness by their kind

The reference lists of the dress-up task panels showed the internal
element names ("Edge4"). They now show "Edge 4" in the user's language
and keep the element name as the item's data, which adding, removing and
highlighting use.

